=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Muckvix} in Lower Jeuno (H-10) for a cutscene to begin the mission.
* Head to {z:Qufim Island} near the entrance to {z:Lower Delkfutt's Tower} and examine the targetable location called **Before Delkfutt's Tower** at (G-6) for a cutscene.
** Fastest route is the {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Qufim Island}.
* Interact with the **Before Delkfutt's Tower** spot again to begin a confrontation with **Echion** (Gigas WAR).
** Has approximately 200k HP.
** Trusts may be used in the fight.
** You will be assisted by the Destiny Destroyers, and the battle will end prematurely if any of them are defeated. You will be unable to heal any of them.
** Echion gains an unremovable Ice Spikes effect following his first Ice Roar that increases in potency after an SP ability is used.
*** Can reach up to 500 damage per spike without defense gear.
*** Damage can be reduced significantly with Barspells, Carols, and/or Magic Evasion.
*** NM can use {p:Mighty Strikes} and {p:Hundred Fists} multiple times.
** Gains access to Colossal Slam (AoE Knockback + Zombie) < 50% HP.
*** Can also use Daunting Hurl (Terror) throughout the fight.
* Interact with the **Before Delkfutt's Tower** location after the fight for a cutscene.
* Return to {n:Muckvix} for the final cutscene and your reward.

